        "title": "Experiential Graphic Designer - Events",
        "disciplines": [
          "AI Creative"
        ],
        "summary": "Design graphics and physical brand experiences for ElevenLabs events, including trade-show booths, environmental graphics, pop-ups, and summits. Translate creative direction into materials that work across spaces and regions.",
