          "Bring concept-to-delivery design experience and a strong understanding of graphics, materials, and physical space.",
          "Advanced Figma and Adobe Illustrator, Photoshop, and InDesign skills are required.",
          "The posting asks for confidence using AI in the design process. Remote globally, with optional company office access."
